WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.078
No percolation at criticality.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.518
Keep each edge with probability p. Exactly at

3
00:00:05.518 --> 00:00:07.897
the threshold, can an infinite cluster exist?

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.252
If it could, it would also exist

5
00:00:11.252 --> 00:00:13.503
slightly below the threshold, which is impossible.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.527
Claimed: never, on every such graph.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.846
Checked in Lean.
